libniji C library (development files and compiler wrapper)
 libniji is an implementation of the GNU C Library's ABI (glibc $abi, x86-64).
 This package installs libniji's C headers, the start files, linker scripts and
 static archives in the sysroot /usr/lib/niji, and niji-gcc and niji-g++, which
 build programs against libniji's headers that run on libniji's loader
 (NIJI_SYSTEM_HEADERS=1 compiles with the system's C headers instead).
